%% Planned before implementation. Existing physical owners remain authoritative.
flowchart TD
    Opening[Approved empty field: purchases and placed buildings] --> Materials[Construct and staff Materials Plant]
    Materials --> Output[Manufacture real Building Materials]
    Output --> Sources[Completion of a Materials Plant publishes its output store as an allowed source for automatic site hauls]
    Sites[Place later facilities] --> Haul[One existing material-haul demand per site]
    Sources --> Haul
    Haul --> Actual[Existing haulers select / reserve / carry / deposit actual stock]
    Actual --> Build[Build Vehicle Works, Park, Training and Logistics Centre]
    Build --> Train[Training selects its actual built school]
    Train --> Hire[Hire first instructor through existing purchase / arrival rules]
    Hire --> Courses[Actual basic training then vehicle-crew course]
    Build --> Recipe[Existing R25 recipe and accepted bay/parking order]
    Build --> Selection[Click completed factory: refresh current Production choices before resolving its stable ID]
    Selection --> Recipe
    Recipe --> Truck[Physically manufactured transport truck]
    Courses --> Board[Qualified Driver walks and boards the actual hull]
    Truck --> Fuel[Worker carries purchased fuel into the tank]
    Board --> Drive[Same hull drives to its promised parking place]
    Fuel --> Drive
    Geometry[Current built geometry; template geometry only in legacy template sessions] --> Board
    Geometry --> Fuel
    Geometry --> Drive
    Geometry --> Load[Actual logistics workers stage and load supplies]
    Drive --> Load
    Load --> Trip[Existing owned trip, HQ unloading and same-hull return]
    Trip --> Repeat[Later explicit or genuine automatic need; new real load]
    Cancel[Cancel site / haul / production / shipment] --> Existing[Existing intent, safe carry, custody and return rules]
    Manual[Explicit single-source haul] -. remains source-specific .-> Actual
